It is a new week and thus a new one-day tournament being held by the never-tiring {{player|meag|flag=sc}}. Similarly to the fourth edition of the Eclipse tournament, this edition will feature the same map pool. The banning of maps when signing up is also familiar feature remaining from previous versions. {{player|Carapace|flag=se}} is the reigning champion  of two weeks and the question remains who is to knock him down and claim the title. 
